WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.468 --> 00:00:03.503 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Actor Anthony Rapp
told reporters this weekend

00:00:03.503 --> 00:00:04.738
that when he was 14 years old,

00:00:04.738 --> 00:00:06.740 align:start size:94% position:6%
Kevin Spacey made
sexual advances towards him.

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:08.174
Spacey apologized on Twitter,

00:00:08.174 --> 00:00:11.044 align:start size:94% position:6%
blaming the event on
inappropriate drunken behavior

00:00:11.044 --> 00:00:13.046 align:start size:94% position:6%
and writing...

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:19.352
One of our writers, Jenny Hagel,
is here to comment

00:00:19.352 --> 00:00:21.621 size:75% position:38%
in a segment we call
"A Lot of Problems."

00:00:21.621 --> 00:00:25.458 align:start size:94% position:6%
♫♫

00:00:25.458 --> 00:00:27.827 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thanks, Seth.

00:00:27.827 --> 00:00:29.963
I´m gay, and as a gay woman,

00:00:29.963 --> 00:00:33.767 align:start size:94% position:6%
I have a lot of problems
with Kevin Spacey´s statement.

00:00:33.767 --> 00:00:36.903 align:start size:94% position:6%
First problem --
it is inappropriate to respond

00:00:36.903 --> 00:00:40.073 align:start size:94% position:6%
to an accusation of pedophilia
by saying, "I´m gay."

00:00:40.073 --> 00:00:42.509 align:start size:94% position:6%
Those two things
are totally unrelated.

00:00:42.509 --> 00:00:44.310 align:start size:94% position:6%
The only
appropriate response to,

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:46.446 size:81% position:41%
"You tried to have sex
with a 14-year-old,"

00:00:46.446 --> 00:00:50.150
is, "I am also a 14-year-old."

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:51.751 align:start size:94% position:6%
Let me be clear.

00:00:51.751 --> 00:00:53.853 align:start size:94% position:6%
Coming out is a courageous
act of honesty,

00:00:53.853 --> 00:00:56.556 align:start size:94% position:6%
not a justification
for a crime you committed.

00:00:56.556 --> 00:01:01.494
That´s why no one goes to court
and says, "I plead gay"...

00:01:01.494 --> 00:01:05.965 align:start size:94% position:6%
or enters the legal term
"gabeas corpus."

00:01:05.965 --> 00:01:07.200 align:start size:94% position:6%
Second problem --

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:08.802 align:start size:94% position:6%
Gay people
are constantly working

00:01:08.802 --> 00:01:11.604
against the incorrect stereotype
that we are sexual predators.

00:01:11.604 --> 00:01:12.906 align:start size:94% position:6%
It´s a stereotype

00:01:12.906 --> 00:01:14.674 align:start size:94% position:6%
that has followed us around
for generations,

00:01:14.674 --> 00:01:16.042
and it´s totally unfounded,

00:01:16.042 --> 00:01:18.411 align:start size:94% position:6%
and Kevin Spacey´s statement
sets us back.

00:01:18.411 --> 00:01:19.846
This is worse for gay people

00:01:19.846 --> 00:01:23.583 align:start size:94% position:6%
than when NBC canceled
"The Golden Girls."

00:01:23.583 --> 00:01:25.318 align:start size:94% position:6%
But don´t worry.
You can still see it on

00:01:25.318 --> 00:01:28.555 align:start size:94% position:6%
TV Land, Lifetime,
Hallmark, Amazon, Logo,

00:01:28.555 --> 00:01:32.258
and at my friend Philip´s house,
because he has the box set.

00:01:32.258 --> 00:01:34.194 align:start size:94% position:6%
Gay people
are actually less likely

00:01:34.194 --> 00:01:36.029 align:start size:94% position:6%
to be pedophiles
than straight people.

00:01:36.029 --> 00:01:38.998 align:start size:94% position:6%
That´s an indisputable fact --
like 2 plus 2 equals 4

00:01:38.998 --> 00:01:43.570 align:start size:94% position:6%
or "K-PAX" has
a 41% on Rotten Tomatoes.

00:01:43.570 --> 00:01:44.904 align:start size:94% position:6%
Third problem --

00:01:44.904 --> 00:01:47.640
Kevin Spacey blamed his actions
on drunken behavior.

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:49.676 align:start size:94% position:6%
That makes it sound like
every gay person

00:01:49.676 --> 00:01:51.611 align:start size:94% position:6%
is two beers away
from molesting a kid.

00:01:51.611 --> 00:01:53.146 align:start size:94% position:6%
I´m not.

00:01:53.146 --> 00:01:57.617
I´m two beers away from singing
"Come to My Window" at karaoke.

00:01:57.617 --> 00:02:01.287
And three beers away from
singing it <i>from </i>my window.

00:02:01.287 --> 00:02:02.722 align:start size:94% position:6%
Fourth problem --

00:02:02.722 --> 00:02:06.159 size:88% position:44%
the phrase "I choose now
to live as a gay man."

00:02:06.159 --> 00:02:08.661 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, <i>now </i>you choose
to live as a gay man

00:02:08.661 --> 00:02:10.663 align:start size:94% position:6%
after you threw us all
under the bus?

00:02:10.663 --> 00:02:12.932
That´s like saying, "I told
everyone you´re an asshole.

00:02:12.932 --> 00:02:15.368 size:81% position:41%
Now I choose to come
to your dinner party."

00:02:15.368 --> 00:02:17.904 align:start size:94% position:6%
Too late.
You´re not invited anymore.

00:02:17.904 --> 00:02:19.739 align:start size:94% position:6%
The gay community
has been made up

00:02:19.739 --> 00:02:21.608
of brave, brilliant people

00:02:21.608 --> 00:02:23.543 align:start size:94% position:6%
like Alan Turing
and Audre Lorde

00:02:23.543 --> 00:02:24.978 size:78% position:39%
and Billie Jean King.

00:02:24.978 --> 00:02:28.047
You´re not in the gay community.
You´re in the creep community.

00:02:28.047 --> 00:02:31.284
Go celebrate creep pride
and throw a little creep parade

00:02:31.284 --> 00:02:33.553 size:84% position:42%
and leave us out of it.

00:02:33.553 --> 00:02:34.654 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah.

00:02:34.654 --> 00:02:36.723 size:84% position:42%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:40.093 --> 00:02:44.531 align:start size:94% position:6%
Also -- Also, "I <i>choose </i>now
to live as a gay man"?

00:02:44.531 --> 00:02:47.534
You don´t choose to be gay.
That´s not how it works, son.

00:02:47.534 --> 00:02:49.936 align:start size:94% position:6%
Do you think I choose
to be rejected by my church

00:02:49.936 --> 00:02:53.406 align:start size:94% position:6%
and own three pairs
of cargo shorts?

00:02:53.406 --> 00:02:55.008 size:78% position:39%
You´re born this way.

00:02:55.008 --> 00:02:58.645 align:start size:94% position:6%
Even a woman in a meat dress
knows that.

00:02:58.645 --> 00:03:02.115 align:start size:94% position:6%
Being gay is a rich
and amazing life experience.

00:03:02.115 --> 00:03:04.417 align:start size:94% position:6%
Assaulting a 14-year-old
is a crime.

00:03:04.417 --> 00:03:06.085 size:81% position:41%
Don´t confuse the two.

00:03:06.085 --> 00:03:09.956
And whatever you do,
don´t watch "K-PAX" on Netflix.

00:03:09.956 --> 00:03:12.492 align:start size:94% position:6%
This has been
"A Lot of Problems."

00:03:12.492 --> 00:03:14.661 size:84% position:42%
[ Cheers and applause ]

